On Fri, 17 Feb 2006, Tom wrote:

> Sorry for the noob question, but how do I attack useing my weapons? I only
> know how to kick or is it done automatically?

Again, the Guidebook has the answer, in Section 7.2.

(For hand to hand combat, it is done automatically when you walk into a
hostile creature. Projectiles are fired with 't' or 'f' (when quivered).
NetHack allows shooting in the major directions only, you cannot target
arbitrary monsters.)

